OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry start before rain quickly
OL,6,Farrives from the southwest. As the
OL,7,Frain spreads northeast it will
OL,8,Fbecoming heavy and perhaps thundery.
OL,9,FRain lingers across northern areas,
OL,10,Fwhile elsewhere showers follow this
OL,11,Fafternoon, these often heavy, thundery
OL,12,Fwith gusty winds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain will
OL,15,Fcontinue across northern areas,
OL,16,Falthough the rain will become light.
OL,17,FElsewhere heavy showers will gradually
OL,18,Ffade, leaving generally dry and cloudy
OL,19,Fconditions.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,168,160,301,260,100,100
