OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FCloudy start with early patchy
OL,6,Frain soon clearing away. Then bright
OL,7,For sunny spells develop along with
OL,8,Fscattered showers, some showers
OL,9,Fbecoming heavy and thundery,
OL,10,Fespecially across Derbyshire later.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FBright
OL,13,For sunny spells and scattered showers
OL,14,Feach day, these sometimes heavy and
OL,15,Fthundery, especially on Monday. Breezy
OL,16,Fat times with temperatures generally
OL,17,Faround normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
